<title>BELGIUM: Dini hopes ERM entry will not slow rate cut.</title>
<headline>Dini hopes ERM entry will not slow rate cut.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian foreign minister Lamberto Dini said on Monday he was satisfied with the lira's return to the European Union's Exchange Rate Mechanism (ERM) but he hoped this would not slow down a cut in Italy's interest rates.</p>
</text>
